    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_1",
      "hanzi": "早上，卡蒂娅、布里斯和安东尼去饭馆。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4480,
      "durationMs": 4480,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_2",
      "hanzi": "他们要吃中国菜。饭馆里人很多。",
      "startMs": 4480,
      "endMs": 9600,
      "durationMs": 3920,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_3",
      "hanzi": "你们吃什么？",
      "startMs": 9600,
      "endMs": 11600,
      "durationMs": 880,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_4",
      "hanzi": "我吃米饭。你呢？",
      "startMs": 11600,
      "endMs": 14160,
      "durationMs": 1600,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_5",
      "hanzi": "我也吃米饭。卡蒂娅，你呢？",
      "startMs": 14160,
      "endMs": 17840,
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_6",
      "hanzi": "我吃面条。",
      "startMs": 17840,
      "endMs": 19920,
      "durationMs": 1120,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_7",
      "hanzi": "老板，两碗米饭，一碗面条。",
      "startMs": 19920,
      "endMs": 23440,
      "durationMs": 2640,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_8",
      "hanzi": "好。还要什么？",
      "startMs": 23440,
      "endMs": 25920,
      "durationMs": 1440,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_9",
      "hanzi": "有茶吗？",
      "startMs": 25920,
      "endMs": 27680,
      "durationMs": 1520,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_10",
      "hanzi": "有。",
      "startMs": 27680,
      "endMs": 28640,
      "durationMs": 960,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_11",
      "hanzi": "我要一杯茶。",
      "startMs": 28640,
      "endMs": 30640,
      "durationMs": 1200,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_12",
      "hanzi": "我要一杯水。",
      "startMs": 30640,
      "endMs": 32800,
      "durationMs": 1200,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_13",
      "hanzi": "我也要水。",
      "startMs": 32800,
      "endMs": 34640,
      "durationMs": 960,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b4_14",
      "hanzi": "好，请等一下。",
      "startMs": 34640,
      "endMs": 37280,
      "durationMs": 1360,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep4_vc_b4_14.mp3"
    },
    {
